SUMMARY:Bailey Mountain Preserve Sober (Curious) Hike
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\n**Bailey Mountain Pres
 erve Hike:**\n**https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/north-carolina/bailey-m
 ountain-summit-via-richard-l-hoffman-trail?p=-1&sh=wqrd1r&utm_medium=trail
 _share&utm_source=alltrails_virality**\n\n**🥾 Length:** 4.4 miles\n**
 ⛰️ Elevation Gain:** 1\,181 ft\n**⏱️ Estimated time:** 2–3 hr\n*
 *🅿️ Parking**: The trailhead is located in a parking lot on Drover's 
 Road Scenic Byway (US 74). The lot is dirt and a good size\, but carpoolin
 g is always encouraged.\n\n🚰 Bring at least 1-2 liters of water.\nBring
 s layers\, it will be a chilly day!\n\nPlease note this is NOT an easy/beg
 inner trail\, it’s an out and back with all of the elevation gain happen
 ing within the first 2.2 miles.\n\n**Dogs are allowed on this trail but MU
 ST be on a leash!**\n\n**COURTESY (Please abide!)**\n\n**Only sign up if y
 ou \\*truly\\ *plan to come.** If you must cancel\, please change your sta
 tus to "Not Going" as soon as possible. Avoid dropping out within 18 hours
  of the hike so wait-listers can have sufficient notice. And please\, plea
 se\, PLEASE don't be a no-show.\n\nIf you have any questions\, message me 
 through Meetup or the event comments.\n\nCell service is spotty in this ar
 ea.\n\n**WE PRACTICE LEAVE NO TRACE**\nFamiliarize yourself with the[ Prin
 ciples of LNT](https://lnt.org/why/7-principles/?gad=1&gclid=Cj0KCQjwr82iB
 hCuARIsAO0EAZz2cwLE7nWUcSWI1w9U7sMZ7rWAM3EMjl7V14wWVFlaT2sF-3hRPLsaAj_LEAL
 w_wcB).\n\n**DISCLAIMER**\nThis Lose the Booze Crew event involves hiking.
  Participants are responsible for their own safety and affirm that they ha
 ve the appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and suppli
 es. Hiking may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike or
 ganizer nor Lose the Booze Crew can assure your safety nor eliminate all r
 isks. Participants assume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\,
  or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-lose-the-booze-crew/events/
 317349524/
