SUMMARY:Final Month - Sonic Journey Through Sound
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nOnly few weekends left before Somatic 
 Sounds relocates to South Florida.\n**I want to Thank Asheville for all th
 e support!**\n\n[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsounds.net/eve
 nts/)\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** (limited capacity)
 \n[https://somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n
 \nSonic Journey Through Sound\nCome experience a somatic journey where anc
 ient wisdom meets modern well-being — a multidimensional soundscape\, ri
 cher and more textured than a traditional sound bath. Vivek guides each se
 ssion with over 40 handcrafted singing bowls\, layered with binaural beats
  to support deep relaxation and nervous system regulation. Participants le
 ave feeling settled in the body and quiet in the mind.\n\nYoga mats\, pill
 ows\, and blankets are provided.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whe
 ther you’re a seasoned mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path t
 o relaxation\, or simply seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a
  spot please use Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3p
 m](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #medit
 ation
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/inner-peace-collective/events/3171346
 29/
