DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nOnly few weekends left before Somatic 
 Sounds relocates to South Florida. If you've been meaning to come\, or wan
 t one more journey together\, now is the time.\n\nI want to Thank Ashevill
 e for all the support!\n\n**Start Your Work Week with a Sound Meditation:*
 *\n[Every Weekend ](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)Sessions @ 11am\, 3p
 m\, 6pm\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** (limited capacit
 y)\n[https://somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)
 \n\nCome immerse yourself in a somatic journey of sound and relaxation\, w
 here ancient wisdom meets modern well‑being. The soothing tones of Himal
 ayan singing bowls wash over you\, calming the mind and renewing the spiri
 t.\n\nFacilitated by Vivek\, this sound journey features over 40 handcraft
 ed singing bowls\, each rich with deeply somatic frequencies and overtones
 . Binaural beats are layered in to support deeper relaxation\, meditation\
 , and nervous system regulation. Together they create a soundscape that go
 es far beyond a traditional sound bath\, inviting clarity\, release\, and 
 inner spaciousness.\n\nOpen to all levels\, whether you're new to this or 
 have been practicing for years.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please use
  Event Link (limited capacity)\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 6pm](https://som
 aticsounds.net/events/)**\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://somaticsounds.net
 /contact/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/inner-peace-collective/events/3171523
 31/
