SUMMARY:Nov 16th MIH Rehearsal at Mission
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\n**Come join with us for some Holiday Cheer as 
 we rehearse some of our Christmas favorites!**\n\nWith Men in Harmony at o
 ur a cappella vocal workshops\, you can explore your vocal abilities by jo
 ining us for an interactive session that covers vocal training\, a cappell
 a techniques\, and group singing tips. Our experienced director will guide
  you through the basics of harmonizing\, breath control\, and performance 
 skills. Get ready to discover the joy of making music together in a suppor
 tive environment.\n**LOCATION\, DAY and TIME!**\n**Come early for Barbersh
 op Polecats and tag singing!!**\n\nMission Cancer Center\, 21 Hospital Dri
 ve. NOT the main Hospital!\n**Entrance to building parking is** on the Rig
 ht side of the building\, off Hamiton St. An **immediate LEFT is** where t
 he BIG Parking lot is located. Come into the building **on the floor level
 **\, into the lobby and there is a corridor on the right where the confere
 nce rooms are. **We'll be rehearsing in conference room R122.**\n**NOTE: P
 lease be on time as the outer doors will be locked after we start rehearsa
 l.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/men-in-harmony/events/317251734/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261102T111518Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T111518Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
