SUMMARY:✨ She Owns It AVL ✨
DESCRIPTION:✨She Owns It AVL✨\n**✨** **She Owns It AVL Meetup✨**\n
 \n**November** Featured Guest:\n**Juliana Ruggiero\,** **Founder & CEO of 
 WinLine Pickleball\,**\nand co-owner of Creekside Sports Club.\n\nWhat sta
 rted as falling in love with a new sport turned into a calling. Juliana fo
 und her people\, her passion\, and a business in the energy and community 
 of pickleball\, and now coaches players of every level to discover what th
 ey’re capable of.\n\nJuliana will share her story: how a young entrepren
 eur followed her curiosity onto the court\, built something of her own\, a
 nd what she’s learning about owning her path along the way.\n\n**Come he
 ar her story and join us for an evening of connection\, conversation\, and
  community💛**\n\n**We can’t wait to see you! 💫**\n**Doors open at 
 5:30**\n\n**We’re so grateful for everyone who signs up to join us! If y
 our plans shift\, please update your RSVP—it helps us plan and opens a s
 pace for another woman to attend.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/she-owns-it-avl/events/317174957/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T135109Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T135109Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
