SUMMARY:Final Weekend - Sonic Journey Through Sound
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nNov 21st & 22nd are the final group se
 ssions. If you've been meaning to come\, or want one more journey together
 \, now is the time.\n**I want to Thank Asheville for all the support!**\n\
 n[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n**\\* $2
 6 to reserve please use the event link** (limited capacity)\n[https://soma
 ticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nSonic Journey
  Through Sound\nCome experience a somatic journey where ancient wisdom mee
 ts modern well-being — a multidimensional soundscape\, richer and more t
 extured than a traditional sound bath. Vivek guides each session with over
  40 handcrafted singing bowls\, layered with binaural beats to support dee
 p relaxation and nervous system regulation. Participants leave feeling set
 tled in the body and quiet in the mind.\n\nYoga mats\, pillows\, and blank
 ets are provided.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whether you’re a
  seasoned mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to relaxation\, 
 or simply seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please us
 e Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://soma
 ticsounds.net/events/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/inner-peace-collective/events/3171750
 68/
