SUMMARY:Sound Healing: Last Session
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nNov 21st & 22nd are the final group se
 ssions. If you've been meaning to come\, or want one more journey together
 \, now is the time.\n\n**I want to Thank Asheville for all the support!**\
 n\n**Start Your Work Week with a Sound Meditation:**\n[Every Weekend ](htt
 ps://somaticsounds.net/events/)Sessions @ 11am\, 3pm\, 6pm\n**\\* $26 to r
 eserve please use the event link** (limited capacity)\n[https://somaticsou
 nds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nCome immerse yourse
 lf in a somatic journey of sound and relaxation\, where ancient wisdom mee
 ts modern well‑being. The soothing tones of Himalayan singing bowls wash
  over you\, calming the mind and renewing the spirit.\n\nFacilitated by Vi
 vek\, this sound journey features over 40 handcrafted singing bowls\, each
  rich with deeply somatic frequencies and overtones. Binaural beats are la
 yered in to support deeper relaxation\, meditation\, and nervous system re
 gulation. Together they create a soundscape that goes far beyond a traditi
 onal sound bath\, inviting clarity\, release\, and inner spaciousness.\n\n
 Open to all levels\, whether you're new to this or have been practicing fo
 r years.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please use Event Link (limited ca
 pacity)\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 6pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)
 **\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://somaticsounds.net/contact/)**\n\n#soundh
 ealing #soundbath #meditation
