 gh meditation and somatic movement themed around the season.\nAccommodatio
 ns/Modification will be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\nWe'll clos
 e out with time for journaling and optional sharing.\n\n***Bring:***\n\nCo
 mfortable clothes to move in\nJournal and pen\nBirth chart if you have it\
 nwater bottle\n\nCash \\|\\| Venmo \\|\\| Card are all accepted at the doo
 r also
