UID:5393caffa964254fc98329c7b27c0024@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Cost: FREE | Recurring daily until Wednesday\, December 23\, 2
 026. Please join us at Blue Spiral 1 in welcoming Candice Methe’s new wo
 rk. Her sculptural ceramics feel at once ancient and deeply personal\, as 
 though they have been carried forward from another time. Built slowly by h
