 8-5581 by 12 noon the Tuesday before each program.\n\n*Facilities are han
 dicap accessible through the main sanctuary narthex.\n\nPlease arrive by 
 10:30 am.\n\n10:00 to 10:30 Fellowship Time\n\n  * Coffee\, tea\, water\,
  cookies and crackers available for snacking\n  * Magazine\, book & puzzl
 e swap\n  * Blood pressure checks\n\n10:30 to 11:00\n\n  * Announcements\
