SUMMARY:Cactus Kate and the Pricks
DESCRIPTION:\nCactus Kate and the Pricks is an Asheville based country-Amer
 icana band whose heartfelt original songs range from sentimental to witty 
 dive bar country. Their music features vocal harmonies\, fiddle solos\, an
 d plenty of small town gossip. Core members include singer-songwriter/fidd
 ler Kate Leigh Bryant\, cellist/bassist Ashlee Booth\, guitarist Curtis Ki
