DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Jeannie Adair
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, December 6th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitat
 or Jeannie Adair\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Jeannie Adair\n\nJeannie is
  a mixed media artist\, experience designer & movement medicine evangelist
 . She curates soulful journeys that invite emotional release & authentic c
 onnection. An AMC facilitator since 2023\, she’s here to hold space with
  intention\, care\, and a loving heart. Find her ecstatic dance mixes on S
 oundcloud at [https://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine](https://soundcloud.c
 om/dancingleontine) and her artwork on Instagram: [https://www.instagram.c
 om/leontine.creative/](https://www.instagram.com/leontine.creative/)\n\n\\
 ~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors 
 close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned awa
 y. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket
  Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of f
 unds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. 
 Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.or
 g/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMG
 YXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJW
 Ezr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT
 S:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note:
  NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam1
 0YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgU
 cbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC
 :\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony w
 here all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. 
 Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community thro
 ugh free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community tran
 sformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bel
 l Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317175548/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T144155Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T144155Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
