SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, December 11th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Facilitator DJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About DJ Mikay
 a (Micah Swabb)\n\nDJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb) is a facilitator at AMC and cre
 ator of dance waves with many styles and flavors within the Ecstatic Dance
  realm. His deejay skill has spanned over two decades covering many ecstat
 ic dance containers\, festivals\, sound healing events and yoga classes. Y
 ou can listen to his catalog of over 80 mixes and mashups at [http://sound
 cloud.com/mikayaswabb](http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb).\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\
 \*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close prompt
 ly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be
  on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15
  - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-r
 egistration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer an
 d dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcol
 lective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/
 ?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIy
 MjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDt
 tUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor w
 ill close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AF
 TER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.o
 rg/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGM
 GYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJ
 WEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville
  Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are
  free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission 
 and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-for
 m dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. 
 AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Ashev
 ille\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317175512/
