X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Static Age Records": "https://link.dice.fm/d89dc042bc90", "Where Y'at AVL Music": "https://www.staticagenc.com/events/holy-locust-johanna-rose"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Static Age Records": "https://link.dice.fm/d89dc042bc90"}
X-SOURCE-ID:dice_static_age
SUMMARY:Holy Locust / Johanna Rose
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261217T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T000000
UID:316927860e32d534461f8b62461fab6a@dice.fm
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-09
 -23/04eb29aa-2dff-4627-86b8-760eb6e362b9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from New Orleans\, **Holy Locust** has built a loyal f
 ollowing through years of relentless DIY touring and a genre-defying blend
  of folk\, punk\, Americana\, and old-time influences. Their live performa
 nces are equal parts high-energy and deeply heartfelt\, as at home in a li
 stening room or theatre as it is underneath a highway overpass or punk hou
 se basement. Holy Locust's music is a unique and at times haunting stateme
 nt of defiance against the exploitation of consumer culture\, making every
