SUMMARY: The Storehouse Food Pantry
DESCRIPTION:Selection of fresh and non-perishable food items for eligible
  Henderson County residents.\n\nGet Help | The Storehouse of Henderson Co
 unty https://storehouseonline.org/get-help\n\n\nWhat to Expect & Bring\n\
 nEligibility: Assistance is available to residents of Henderson County fa
 cing food insecurity.\n\nWhat to Bring: Valid photo ID and proof of Hende
 rson County residency (like a recent utility bill\, lease agreement\, or 
 official mail with your current address).\n\nNo appointment necessary. Yo
 u can visit the pantry during regular operating hours. Service is general
 ly provided on a first-come\, first-served basis.\n\nThe Process: Volunte
 ers will greet you\, help you with a brief registration\, and provide you
  with a selection of fresh and non-perishable food items.
