SUMMARY:Blue Ridge Betty
DESCRIPTION:\nBlue Ridge Betty was formed in the aftermath of Hurricane 
 Helene in the Bent Creek neighborhood in Asheville\, NC. The band released
  their first all original album “Firefly” in July 2025\, and it was fe
 atured on WNCW’s new tunes at 2. Blue Ridge Betty continues to deve
 lop their Americana sound\, by blending harmonies\, acoustic and electric
  instruments\, and jam-inspiring grooves. Their second album was released
  in Spring 2026.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tICqhwcTkLA&amp\
 ;list=RDtICqhwcTkLA&amp\;start_radio=1\n\n\n\n\n\n
