DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T140000
DTSTAMP:20261104T152520Z
CREATED:20261104T150828Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T152520Z
UID:28004-1797768000-1797775200@www.ashevilleart.org
SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds | Eric Congdon
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of music and art in the Museum. With a soundscape of classical guitar music\, we invite you to experience artwork in the galleries in a more emotional and sensory way. \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nEric Congdon is one of Western North Carolina’s premier artists.  He has been voted best guitarist four times by Mountain X reader poll 2022-2025 and performs on the biggest stages all over the region. \nFor more info please visit www.ericcongdon.com \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/sunday-sounds-eric-congdon-4/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/ff69bb48-3e18-4856-8f24-d7b33e65f14a.jpg
END:VEVENT
