SUMMARY:New Year’s Eve Dinner Buffet ~ Lake Lure\, N.C. 🥳🍾🥂🎊
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Let’s celebrate the incoming new
  year 2027 by celebrating at La Strada Restaurant in Lake Lure! It’s loc
 ated right across the beach at Lake Lure with awesome views! Come join me!
  🥂**\n\n**We will be attending** **an** **all-you-care-to-eat dinner bu
 ffet\, The menu offers a lot in variety so come hungry! 😋 See menu/webs
 ite below.**\n\n**They have two seatings - 5:30 PM and 7:30 PM. I chose th
 e 5:30 PM so we can eat and get home safely before it gets too terribly da
 rk to drive. If possible y’all might want to carpool.**\n\n**SHOUT-OUT:*
 * **📣Thanks to Cathy for telling me about this New Year’s Eve dinner 
 buffet!**\n\n**TABLE RESERVATIONS: 🍽️** **We have table reservations 
 for 20 at 5:30 PM.**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE:** **www.lastradaatlakelure.com**\n
 **Tap on restaurant events for New Year’s Eve menu. Menu will also be po
 sted in photos for this event. Vegetarian\, vegan\, and gluten-free option
 s offered in the buffet.**\n\n**COST:** **$*****32.95 per person. Does not
  include tax\, gratuity\, or alcoholic & non-alcoholic drinks. 🍷 🍺**
 * **By the way\, champagne will be offered. 🍾 You do not pay in advance
 .**\n\n**LATE CANCELLATIONS/NO-SHOWS:** **Please cancel soon as you can so
  if there is someone on the waitlist they can attend. As for being a no-sh
 ow that’s a big NO-NO\, especially on a holiday event!! 👎**\n\n**PARK
 ING:🅿️ Plenty of** **parking** **available. 🚗**\n\n**So come join 
 me if you can for I don’t want to eat/celebrate alone! I’ll be waiting
  for you in the entryway of the restaurant prior to our 5:30 PM seating.**
  **HAPPY NEW YEAR!!** **🎊 🥳🍾**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS?**\n**Shae
  Kemerer ~ (828)699-8180 (Call or text)**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**
