X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_seniorsinglesfunbunch
X-SOURCE:Senior Singles Fun Bunch
UID:event_317245499@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061223Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270101T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270101T140000
SUMMARY:New Year’s Day Polar Bear  Plunge & Centennial Celebration ~ Lak
 e Lure\, N.C.
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Let’s start the New Year 2027 
 🥳 off by going to the Polar Plunge at Lake Lure! And better yet\, why n
 ot register to take the plunge?! I will cheer you on for there’s no way 
 you’re getting me into that cold water! Brrrrr! 🧊 💦 But I would lo
 ve to see you do it!! 😂 This will be a fun event!! So come join me!! Th
 ere will be bonfires\, 🔥 hot chocolate\, cookies\, 🍪 music 🎵 and 
 prizes for best costumes and for the youngest and oldest plunger! Fun! 
 🤩**\n\n**A GOOD CAUSE: This annual New Year’s event in Lake Lure (exc
 ept for the last couple of years due to the hurricane devastation) draws h
 undreds of people who jump into the lake to help raise money for local fir
 st responders.**\n\n**This year it’s being promoted as the first event o
 f the Hickory Nut Gorge Chamber’s centennial year with proceeds benefiti
 ng the Lake Lure Fire Department. 👨‍🚒👩‍🚒**\n\n**REGISTER T
 O JUMP INTO THE LAKE:**\n**Register after Thanksgiving in person at the La
 ke Lure Beach House. 2724 Memorial Highway\, Lake Lure\, N.C. between 10:3
 0-11:30 AM. No online registration is available. Additional information at
  www.hickorynutchamber.org.**\n\n**PETS: 🐶 No dogs allowed on the beach
 .**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️ I strongly suggest you come early to find a park
 ing place.**\n\n**WHERE TO FIND ME: I’ll try and be in the La Strada par
 king lot at 11:00 AM so we can meet up. I’ll have my colorful corgi bag 
 on me as usual. Look at photos below to see my bag. You can text me or cal
 l me\, too. (828)699-8180.**\n\n**AFTER THE PLUNGE ~~**\n**A BITE TO EAT: 
 I plan on grabbing a bite to eat (after the plunge is over) at the La Stra
 da Restaurant which is located right across the street from the beach. The
 y do not take reservations. So come join me for a bite if you like. I have
  no idea what exact time I’ll be there though. It depends on how things 
 go at the plunge ~~ so just look for me inside. Menu at www.lastradaatlake
 lure.com.**\n\n**PARKING & PETS: 🅿️🐶 Usually there is ample parkin
 g at the restaurant\, but with all of the activities it may be limited.**\
 n**Pets are only allowed on the covered outdoor patio. The restaurant even
  provides a doggie menu! 🐶 Woof!**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae K
 emerer (828)699-8180 (Text or Call)**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**Always 
 feel free to contact me. I’ll help you in any way that I can.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31724549
 9/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261101T223342Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261101T223342Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
