SUMMARY:Weekly Weaverville Sign Waving
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270114T134500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270114T143000
UID:fa93da3994c8249b224b72a948011dd1@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Weaverville%2Bsign%2Bwaving%2BLooking%2Bforward_2026110816044
 0020739.png
DESCRIPTION:Our N. Buncombe Dems have been sign-waving and protesting EVER
 Y week since June 2025. Now that we achieved our Blue Wave\, we decided to
  continue to "sign wave" with positive ideas on how to repair our democrac
 y. The joy we receive from the many cars passing by with honks\, cheers an
 d waves made us realize we need to continue this effort. We do it for them
  as well as for us. This sense of joy and renewing our democracy is contag
